# Phase 7 - Security Validation

## Validation Steps

1. Login as an administrator.
2. Open an Incident with Priority = Critical.
3. Verify that the record is accessible.

4. Login as a non-admin user.
5. Try to access the same Critical Incident.
6. Verify that access is denied.

7. Open a non-Critical Incident as a non-admin user.
8. Verify that the record is accessible.

## Security Rule

Only administrators can read Critical Incident records.
Other users can read non-Critical Incident records.
